From: SteamOS-ARM-SM8650
Subject: [PATCH] input: konkr_sysbtn: also bind the Pocket FIT (SM8650) MCU

The non-Elite Pocket FIT has its controller MCU on the same geni SE
(uart13 @894000, "AYANEO Controller serial interface" in the ROCKNIX
dtsi). Whether it speaks the Elite's KR02 frames is unverified, so the
image ships the module blacklisted and the user opts in (konkr-mcu).
An MCU that ignores the enable frame simply produces no events.

---
--- a/drivers/input/misc/konkr_sysbtn.c
+++ b/drivers/input/misc/konkr_sysbtn.c
@@ -729,4 +729,5 @@
 static const struct of_device_id konkr_sysbtn_of_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "konkr,pf-elite-mcu" },
+	{ .compatible = "konkr,pocket-fit-mcu" },
 	{ }
 };
